fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></span><div><p class="text-purple-deep font-display text-2xl">Stand firm in the promise</p><p class="text-muted mt-1 text-sm">Scripture for the fight</p></div></div><ul class="mt-7 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><li class="border-line border-t pt-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><p class="text-purple-deep text-sm font-bold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/2%20Timothy/1/7-9" title="Open 2 Timothy 1:7-9 in Bible Search">2 Timothy 1:7-9</a></span></span></p><p class="text-ink mt-1 text-sm leading-6">For God hath not given us the spirit of fear; but of power, and of love, and of a sound mind.</p></li><li class="border-line border-t pt-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><p class="text-purple-deep text-sm font-bold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Romans/15/13" title="Open Romans 15:13 in Bible Search">Romans 15:13</a></span></span></p><p class="text-ink mt-1 text-sm leading-6">Now the God of hope fill you with all joy and peace in believing, that ye may abound in hope, through the power of the Holy Ghost.</p></li><li class="border-line border-t pt-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><p class="text-purple-deep text-sm font-bold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Galatians/5/16-17" title="Open Galatians 5:16-17 in Bible Search">Galatians 5:16-17</a></span></span></p><p class="text-ink mt-1 text-sm leading-6">This I say then, Walk in the Spirit, and ye shall not fulfil the lust of the flesh.</p></li><li class="border-line border-t pt-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><p class="text-purple-deep text-sm font-bold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Ephesians/6/12" title="Open Ephesians 6:12 in Bible Search">Ephesians 6:12</a></span></span></p><p class="text-ink mt-1 text-sm leading-6">For we wrestle not against flesh and blood, but against principalities, against powers, against the rulers of the darkness of this world, against spiritual wickedness in high places.</p></li><li class="border-line border-t pt-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><p class="text-purple-deep text-sm font-bold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Matthew/5/17" title="Open Matthew 5:17 in Bible Search">Matthew 5:17</a></span></span></p><p class="text-ink mt-1 text-sm leading-6">Think not that I am come to destroy the law, or the prophets: I am not come to destroy, but to fulfill.</p></li><li class="border-line border-t pt-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><p class="text-purple-deep text-sm font-bold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Romans/12/21" title="Open Romans 12:21 in Bible Search">Romans 12:21</a></span></span></p><p class="text-ink mt-1 text-sm leading-6">Be not overcome of evil, but overcome evil with good.</p></li></ul></article></div><div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="border-line rounded-2xl border bg-white p-5"><p class="text-purple-deep font-display text-xl leading-tight">God will use all things for your own good, to shape you in the Image of Christ.</p><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-4"><li class="border-line border-t pt-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><p class="text-purple-deep text-sm font-bold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Romans/8/28-29" title="Open Romans 8:28-29 in Bible Search">Romans 8:28-29</a></span></span></p><p class="text-ink mt-1 text-sm leading-6">And we know that all things work together for good to them that love God...</p></li></ul></article><article class="border-line rounded-2xl border bg-white p-5"><p class="text-purple-deep font-display text-xl leading-tight">He will never leave you</p><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-4"><li class="border-line border-t pt-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><p class="text-purple-deep text-sm font-bold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Matthew/28/20" title="Open Matthew 28:20 in Bible Search">Matthew 28:20</a></span></span></p><p class="text-ink mt-1 text-sm leading-6">...I am with you alway, even unto the end of the world. Amen.</p></li></ul></article><article class="border-line rounded-2xl border bg-white p-5"><p class="text-purple-deep font-display text-xl leading-tight">He will give you wisdom if you ask for it</p><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-4"><li class="border-line border-t pt-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><p class="text-purple-deep text-sm font-bold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/James/1/5" title="Open James 1:5 in Bible Search">James 1:5</a></span></span></p><p class="text-ink mt-1 text-sm leading-6">If any of you lack wisdom, let him ask of God, that giveth to all men liberally...</p></li></ul></article><article class="border-line rounded-2xl border bg-white p-5"><p class="text-purple-deep font-display text-xl leading-tight">He Knows what we need</p><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-4"><li class="border-line border-t pt-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><p class="text-purple-deep text-sm font-bold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Philippians/4/19" title="Open Philippians 4:19 in Bible Search">Philippians 4:19</a></span></span></p><p class="text-ink mt-1 text-sm leading-6">But my God shall supply all your need according to his riches in glory by Christ Jesus.</p></li><li class="border-line border-t pt-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><p class="text-purple-deep text-sm font-bold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Matthew/6/25-32" title="Open Matthew 6:25-32 in Bible Search">Matthew 6:25-32</a></span></span></p><p class="text-ink mt-1 text-sm leading-6">Therefore I say unto you, Take no thought for your life...</p></li></ul></article><article class="border-line rounded-2xl border bg-white p-5"><p class="text-purple-deep font-display text-xl leading-tight">He gives you peace in ways we don’t understand</p><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-4"><li class="border-line border-t pt-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><p class="text-purple-deep text-sm font-bold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Philippians/4/7" title="Open Philippians 4:7 in Bible Search">Philippians 4:7</a></span></span></p><p class="text-ink mt-1 text-sm leading-6">And the peace of God, which passeth all understanding, shall keep your hearts and minds through Christ Jesus.</p></li></ul></article></div><div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="bg-purple-deep rounded-2xl p-6 text-white"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-book-open text-yellow size-6" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 7v14"></path><path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path></svg><h3 class="font-display mt-5 text-2xl">You are a Temple of the Holy Spirit</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/85">The Holy Spirit dwells in us; We are His temple. So we must keep his temple clean as best we can.</p></article><article class="bg-teal rounded-2xl p-6 text-white"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-sparkles text-yellow size-6" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg><h3 class="font-display mt-5 text-2xl">God gave you more power than you believe</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/85">Satan has no power over you, in the sense that he cannot force us to sin or harm ourselves and others; but he is the master of deception and the father of lies. God promised us that if we submit to His will and resist the Devil; Satan will flee from us. (<a class="text-purple-deep font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/James/4/7" title="Open James 4:7 in Bible Search">James 4:7</a>)</p></article><article class="bg-yellow text-purple-deep rounded-2xl p-6"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-heart size-6" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"></path></svg><h3 class="font-display mt-5 text-2xl">If God is with you, who can be against you</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6"><a class="text-purple-deep font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Romans/8/31-39" title="Open Romans 8:31-39 in Bible Search">Romans 8:31-39</a>: "If God be for us, who can be against us?"</p></article></div></div></section><section class="scroll-mt-20 bg-white" id="laws"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.78fr)_minmax(0,1.22fr)] lg:items-start"><div><p class="text-purple text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.22em] uppercase">Step 1</p><h2 class="font-display text-purple-deep mt-3 text-4xl leading-tight sm:text-5xl">Check Yourself before you wreck yourself</h2><p class="text-ink mt-5 text-lg leading-8">Take a look at the mirror of your soul – God’s commandments will shine light on you and demonstrate your dire need for The Saviour.</p><figure class="kja-tablets"><img alt="The Ten Commandments in gold letters on two stone tablets" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900" src="https://knowingjesus.today/wp-content/plugins/kjt-site-pictures/fallback/assets/images/armoury-tablets-2026.webp"><figcaption>The Ten Commandments · <a href="/bible-corner/#/read/kjva/Exodus/20">Exodus 20</a></figcaption></figure></div><div><h3 class="font-display text-purple-deep text-3xl">Step 1: Know &amp; Follow God's Laws</h3><p class="text-purple mt-2 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase">The Ten Commandments</p><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><article class="border-line bg-paper flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-4"><span class="text-purple bg-purple-soft grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">01</span><div><h3 class="text-purple-deep text-sm leading-5 font-bold">One God. No other.</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1 text-xs font-semibold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Exodus/20/2" title="Open Exodus 20:2 in Bible Search">Exodus 20:2</a></span></span></p></div></article><article class="border-line bg-paper flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-4"><span class="text-purple bg-purple-soft grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">02</span><div><h3 class="text-purple-deep text-sm leading-5 font-bold">Bow down to &amp; serve only God (respect yourself)</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1 text-xs font-semibold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Exodus/20/4" title="Open Exodus 20:4 in Bible Search">Exodus 20:4</a></span></span></p></div></article><article class="border-line bg-paper flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-4"><span class="text-purple bg-purple-soft grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">03</span><div><h3 class="text-purple-deep text-sm leading-5 font-bold">God's name is Holy, don't disrespect Him</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1 text-xs font-semibold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Exodus/20/7" title="Open Exodus 20:7 in Bible Search">Exodus 20:7</a></span></span></p></div></article><article class="border-line bg-paper flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-4"><span class="text-purple bg-purple-soft grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">04</span><div><h3 class="text-purple-deep text-sm leading-5 font-bold">Remember the Sabbath (honour God / take a break / get some rest)</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1 text-xs font-semibold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Exodus/20/8-11" title="Open Exodus 20:8-11 in Bible Search">Exodus 20:8-11</a></span></span></p></div></article><article class="border-line bg-paper flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-4"><span class="text-purple bg-purple-soft grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">05</span><div><h3 class="text-purple-deep text-sm leading-5 font-bold">Honour your parents</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1 text-xs font-semibold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Exodus/20/12" title="Open Exodus 20:12 in Bible Search">Exodus 20:12</a></span></span></p></div></article><article class="border-line bg-paper flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-4"><span class="text-purple bg-purple-soft grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">06</span><div><h3 class="text-purple-deep text-sm leading-5 font-bold">Don't kill</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1 text-xs font-semibold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Exodus/20/13" title="Open Exodus 20:13 in Bible Search">Exodus 20:13</a></span></span></p></div></article><article class="border-line bg-paper flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-4"><span class="text-purple bg-purple-soft grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">07</span><div><h3 class="text-purple-deep text-sm leading-5 font-bold">Don't commit adultery (respect your spouse)</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1 text-xs font-semibold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Exodus/20/14" title="Open Exodus 20:14 in Bible Search">Exodus 20:14</a></span></span></p></div></article><article class="border-line bg-paper flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-4"><span class="text-purple bg-purple-soft grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">08</span><div><h3 class="text-purple-deep text-sm leading-5 font-bold">Don't steal</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1 text-xs font-semibold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Exodus/20/15" title="Open Exodus 20:15 in Bible Search">Exodus 20:15</a></span></span></p></div></article><article class="border-line bg-paper flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-4"><span class="text-purple bg-purple-soft grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">09</span><div><h3 class="text-purple-deep text-sm leading-5 font-bold">Don't lie or be a false witness (have integrity)</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1 text-xs font-semibold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Exodus/20/16" title="Open Exodus 20:16 in Bible Search">Exodus 20:16</a></span></span></p></div></article><article class="border-line bg-paper flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-4"><span class="text-purple bg-purple-soft grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">10</span><div><h3 class="text-purple-deep text-sm leading-5 font-bold">Don't covet what is not yours</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1 text-xs font-semibold"><span><span><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Exodus/20/17" title="Open Exodus 20:17 in Bible Search">Exodus 20:17</a></span></span></p></div></article></div><div class="border-yellow bg-yellow/15 mt-5 rounded-2xl border-l-4 p-5"><p class="text-purple-deep font-display text-2xl">Only God Is Good</p><p class="text-ink mt-2 text-sm leading-6">We Must Repent from Sin (<a class="text-purple-deep font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Romans/3/10-12" title="Open Romans 3:10-12 in Bible Search">Romans 3:10-12</a>). You cannot serve 2 Masters.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-purple-deep scroll-mt-20 text-white" id="mind"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20 lg