prayer.</p><div class="kja-jesus-prayer"><p class="kja-jesus-prayer__label">The Jesus Prayer</p><p class="font-display kja-jesus-prayer__text">Lord Jesus Christ, Son of God, have mercy on me, a sinner.</p><p class="kja-jesus-prayer__hint">Say it slowly, again and again, with your breath and with your heart.</p></div><a class="kja-mini" href="/bible-corner/#today-with-god"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://knowingjesus.today/wp-content/plugins/kjt-site-pictures/assets/heroes/hero-holy-bible.webp"><span><strong>Pray with the Church today</strong><span>Today with God: the day’s readings, saints, feasts and fasts on the Holy Bible page</span></span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="kja-arrow" fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.4" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><article class="kja-preview" aria-label="On the Prayer page"><a class="kja-preview__hero" href="/watch-and-pray/prayer/"><img alt="Open hands holding a glowing Orthodox cross against a sunrise sky" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://knowingjesus.today/wp-content/plugins/kjt-site-pictures/assets/heroes/hero-prayer.webp" style="object-position:74% 55%"><span class="kja-preview__shade"></span><span class="kja-preview__tag">Salvation · Prayer</span><span class="font-display kja-preview__title">Pray Always</span></a><div class="kja-preview__body"><p class="kja-preview__intro">On the Prayer page</p><ul class="kja-list"><li><a href="/watch-and-pray/prayer/#daily-prayers"><strong>Daily prayers</strong><span>Prayers for daily life and reading</span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="kja-arrow" fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.4" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"><